# /etc/ssh/sshd_config - SSH Security Hardening Parameters
# Target: Ubuntu Server 24.04 / 22.04 LTS

LogLevel INFO
LoginGraceTime 60
PermitRootLogin no
MaxAuthTries 4
MaxSessions 10
PermitEmptyPasswords no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
UsePAM yes
ClientAliveInterval 15
ClientAliveCountMax 3
X11Forwarding yes
PrintMotd no
